# Anything private stays out of this repository — the repository itself is public.
#
# What a secret looks like: nothing in this list is committed, and nothing like it ever should be.
# The only key that belongs in a tracked file is the Supabase PUBLISHABLE key in
# assets/supabase-config.js, which Supabase marks safe to share and which row-level security
# makes harmless on its own.

# VIN lists, exports, scratch files
private/
*.cardna
cardna-vault-*.json
cardna-vins-*.txt

# Keys and certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
service-role*
service_role*
sb_secret_*
*.secret

# Environment files, in every form they are written
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env.local

# Supabase CLI state (holds the local database and its keys)
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/

# Local environment and editor noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Agent skills kept on this device only — not part of the published site
Skills/
